    oe:answerText "The role of long-term beta-blocker therapy after a myocardial infarction in patients without left ventricular systolic dysfunction or heart failure is unclear in the era of contemporary coronary-artery reperfusion and secondary prevention interventions. We conducted an open-label, randomized, noninferiority trial at 25 centers in South Korea."^^xsd:string ;
